== History ==
2016
*The P.E.K.K.A [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], decreased the P.E.K.K.A's hitpoints by 13% and decreased her cost to 7 [[Elixir]] (from 8 Elixir). It also changed the walking animation of the P.E.K.K.A.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the P.E.K.K.A's sight range to 5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May%202016%20Update%20(3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], fixed the "range bug" and decreased the P.E.K.K.A's range to 0.75 tiles (from 1.5 tiles), but her effective range was unchanged.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the P.E.K.K.A's damage by 8%.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the P.E.K.K.A's damage by 5%. There was also an unannounced change to the P.E.K.K.A, a decrease to her first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.6 seconds).
2017
*On 13/2/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (13/2/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the P.E.K.K.A's deployment time to 1 second (from 3 seconds).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], made a small change to the P.E.K.K.A's card description.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 5/8/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/8/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the P.E.K.K.A's hitpoints by 9.5% but increased her range to 1.6 tiles (from 0.75 tiles), now classified as Melee: Long.
*On 2/9/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the P.E.K.K.A's range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.6 tiles), now classified as Melee: Medium.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the P.E.K.KA's card info screen.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 27/6/2022, the [[Version History#Summer%202022%20Update%20(27/6/2022)|Summer 2022 Update]], added the Armor Breaker [[Card Mastery]] task for the P.E.K.K.A.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the P.E.K.K.A's range to 1.6 tiles (from 1.2 tiles), now classified as Melee: Long.
